              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Reading? (पठनम्, paṭhanam.) Listening? (श्रवणम्, śravaṇam.) A speech? (भाषणम्, bhāṣaṇam.) A discussion? (चर्चा, carcā.) A dispute? (विवादः, vivādaḥ.) A plan? (योजना, yojanā.) A goal? (लक्ष्यम्, lakṣyam.) A way? (उपायः, upāyaḥ.) A problem? (समस्या, samasyā.) A solution? (समाधानम्, samādhānam.) A wayfarer? (पथिकः, pathikaḥ.) A direction? (दिशा, diśā.) The east? (पूर्वा, pūrvā.) The west? (पश्चिमा, paścimā.) The north? (उत्तरा, uttarā.)"
